OL,3,C'Tunnel vision' meant Manchester derby
OL,4,Cwinner stood, referee chief says
OL,6,FReferees' chief Howard Webb believes
OL,7,F"tunnel vision" from VAR led to
OL,8,FManchester City's derby winner being
OL,9,Fallowed to stand.
OL,11,FManchester City striker Erling
OL,12,FHaaland's goal was given after a VAR
OL,13,Freview in the match against Manchester
OL,14,FUnited at Old Trafford on Sunday, 13
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FBut video officials had made an error
OL,18,Fin failing to identify an offside
OL,19,Foffence by Enzo Fernandez, diving at
OL,20,Fthe ball.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
