PN,36102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1789941876
OL,3,C'Tunnel vision' meant Manchester derby
OL,4,Cwinner stood, referee chief says
OL,6,FThe decision to award the goal has
OL,7,Fcaused uproar, and even calls for VAR
OL,8,Fto be scrapped altogether.
OL,10,FWebb, the chief refereeing officer at
OL,11,FPro Ref said he was "really
OL,12,Fdisappointed" with the mistake made by
OL,13,Fthe VAR Matt Donohue and assistant
OL,14,FBlake Antrobus.
OL,16,FHe said: "I was really disappointed
OL,17,Fwith this outcome. We all are. None
OL,18,Fmore so than the officials themselves.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1789941876
OL,3,C'Tunnel vision' meant Manchester derby
OL,4,Cwinner stood, referee chief says
OL,6,F"They take a lot of personal pride in
OL,7,Fwhat they do and they're obviously
OL,8,Fhurting now, having fallen short in
OL,9,Fthis situation. They'll not be
OL,10,Fofficiating again until after the
OL,11,Finternational break.
OL,13,F"We've reached out to Manchester
OL,14,FUnited and acknowledged the error, as
OL,15,Fwe do when these things happen.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1789941876
OL,3,C'Tunnel vision' meant Manchester derby
OL,4,Cwinner stood, referee chief says
OL,6,F"They don't happen that often, but we
OL,7,Fwant to ensure that we are transparent
OL,8,Fand open, and we've played the audio
OL,9,Fand the footage to the football club
OL,10,Fto let them know what happened, and
OL,11,Fwe're going to review this situation
OL,12,Fto understand what elements of process
OL,13,Ffell down in this situation which
OL,14,Fmeant we didn't get to the right
OL,15,Foutcome."
OL,17,FHe said he felt Donohue was too
OL,18,Ffocused on whether or not Fernandez
OL,19,Fhad touched the ball, rather than
OL,20,Fconsidering whether he was interfering.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1789941876
OL,3,C'Tunnel vision' meant Manchester derby
OL,4,Cwinner stood, referee chief says
OL,6,FWebb added: "In that moment, he gets
OL,7,Ftunnel vision.
OL,9,F"He gets focused on Haaland, and it's
OL,10,Fdown to the rest of his team to pull
OL,11,Fhim out of that tunnel, and
OL,12,Funfortunately, that didn't happen on
OL,13,Fthis occasion.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1789941876
OL,3,C'Tunnel vision' meant Manchester derby
OL,4,Cwinner stood, referee chief says
OL,6,F"When you watch it casually, you
OL,7,Fthink, 'Well, this is obviously
OL,8,Foffside against Fernandez'. When
OL,9,Fyou're sat in that chair, and you've
OL,10,Fgot other things going through your
OL,11,Fhead in relation to the process that
OL,12,Fyou need to follow to establish
OL,13,FHaaland's position, to follow through
OL,14,Fthe attacking phase of play, you can
OL,15,Fget that tunnel-vision sort of effect.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1789941876
OL,3,C'Tunnel vision' meant Manchester derby
OL,4,Cwinner stood, referee chief says
OL,6,F"We've seen that before. We've put
OL,7,Fprocesses in place that protect us
OL,8,Ffrom that, with the assistant VAR
OL,9,Fstepping in to pull the VAR out of
OL,10,Fthat tunnel, but it didn't happen on
OL,11,Fthis occasion."
OL,13,FUnited head coach Michael Carrick said
OL,14,Fit was "worrying" that the goal had
OL,15,Fbeen allowed to stand.
OL,17,FWebb also felt referee Michael Oliver
OL,18,Fwas right to send off City midfielder
OL,19,FPhil Foden for kicking out at Bruno
OL,20,FFernandes earlier in the same game.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
